#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
#
# qubes-vhost-backend — vhost-user-net backend daemon for sys-net
#
# Runs inside sys-net (the VM that owns the physical NIC via VFIO
# passthrough).  Bridges traffic between the physical NIC and one or
# more vhost-user Unix sockets that QEMU instances (in dom0) connect to
# on behalf of client VMs.
#
# Architecture:
#   Physical NIC  <-->  raw socket / AF_PACKET  <-->  vhost-user sockets
#
# Each downstream client VM gets its own vhost-user socket.  The backend
# multiplexes Ethernet frames between the physical interface and all
# connected clients using MAC-address based forwarding.
#
